{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an alien treasure hunter of the far future</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the journey of treasure hunter sisters, Millie and Merang, who have come to find the relics of the abandoned planet 'Earth'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the camera with the WASD keys and aim with the mouse. Click to fire your weapon. Wipe out all the monsters on the battlefield and keep Merang safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Weapons</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 20 unique weapons. A variety of playstyles makes every game feel new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase permanent upgrades with the money earned from defeating monsters! Don't give up; consistent upgrades will make you stronger.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354320?t=1760667220","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3354320?t=1760667220","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354320/d299ba976ca48a70a8fcf51b3afd788a0ddbfcb1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760667220","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354320/d299ba976ca48a70a8fcf51b3afd788a0ddbfcb1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760667220","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Become an alien treasure hunter of the far future</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the journey of treasure hunter sisters, Millie and Merang, who have come to find the relics of the abandoned planet 'Earth'.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move the camera with the WASD keys and aim with the mouse. Click to fire your weapon. Wipe out all the monsters on the battlefield and keep Merang safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Various Weapons</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use 20 unique weapons. A variety of playstyles makes every game feel new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrades</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can purchase permanent upgrades with the money earned from defeating monsters! Don't give up; consistent upgrades will make you stronger.</p>","developers":["nogagong"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3354320/242aaeca4729359808c291166c0e08b5ad451b43/header.jpg?t=1760667220","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3354320/203851788/5fda092848d008d24ddf26420cd0f16cb0250bba/1756543773/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756544558","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3354320/203851788/5fda092848d008d24ddf26420cd0f16cb0250bba/1756543773/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756544558","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3354320/203851788/5fda092848d008d24ddf26420cd0f16cb0250bba/1756543773/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756544558","id":257080218,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080218/movie480.mp4?t=1756544558","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257080218/movie_max.mp4?t=1756544558"},"name":"First","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257080218/c482e4ceb317aa04955292eada4d95b0af346726/movie_600x337.jp